  <h2>The Technology</h2>

  <p>ReflecToes uses proprietary retroreflective materials with a bonding technology engineered for washability. Unlike iron-on reflective patches that crack and peel, the reflective elements are integrated into the fabric construction to maintain performance through repeated washing.</p>

  <p>The material uses a glass microsphere system: tiny beads that refract incoming headlight beams back toward their source. Because a driver's eyes are on roughly the same axis as their headlights, the returned light lands precisely where they're looking.</p>

